    {
      "text": "Prospering spring light is a rank eight immortal material. Although it is light path, it is condensed as a flower: pure white petals with bright red specks and blotches of bright green, lifelike, delicate, and bursting with vitality.",
      "chapters": [
        1803
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
