      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Long Hair refinement path formation, prospering spring light is the main immortal material added first to the fire. It melts into pure white light that pours over Fang Yuan’s split soul and fully covers it. False pearl follows as the next main material and is covered on false pearl.",
